### ============================================================
### UDC File Upload — 4-Step API (REST Client / VS Code .http)
### ============================================================

### Variables — fill these in
@authority = https://builder-federated-identity-sit.honeywellforge.com
@tokenServiceBase = https://dis.lss.qa.honeywellforge.com
@siteId = 3a91df7d-eca4-49a9-b0af-2c5f35a2fc7b
@username = lss-dp01-sit-bg-svc
@password = 7973a5cb-39b6-401e-a1cf-72adaf3ee3dd
@filePath = C:\AI\FILES\UDC_TS_SPA2K12_20260506043457965_1_R170.1.txt

### ============================================================
### Step 1 — Obtain Access Token
### ============================================================
# @name getToken
POST {{authority}}/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=builder.access

### Save token from response
@accessToken = {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}

### ============================================================
### Step 2 — Get Upload Connection Details (SAS URL)
### ============================================================
# @name getUploadDetails
POST {{tokenServiceBase}}/Token/v2/GetSiteSpecificStorageAccessSignatureConnectionString
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "SiteID": "{{siteId}}"
}

### Save connection string and path from response
@connectionString = {{getUploadDetails.response.body.connectionString}}
@uploadPath = {{getUploadDetails.response.body.path}}

### ============================================================
### Step 3 — Upload File to Blob Storage
### ============================================================
### After running Step 2, copy the connectionString from the response
### and replace [#FILENAME#] with your actual filename below:
@uploadUrl = https://storage.lss.qa.honeywellforge.com/lss-dp01-sit/3a91df7d-eca4-49a9-b0af-2c5f35a2fc7b/ES/5-21-2026/5/UDC_TS_SPA2K12_20260506043457965_1_R170.1.txt?sv=2018-03-28&sr=c&sig=KMPCO42VmkG3mATNSgQr5urUh2QWDQYkJhHck0UHhjk%3D&se=2026-05-21T11%3A41%3A48Z&sp=rcwl

# @name uploadFile
PUT {{uploadUrl}}
x-ms-blob-type: BlockBlob
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< {{filePath}}

### ============================================================
### Step 4 — Send Completion Event
### ============================================================
### This triggers server-side decryption if file is encrypted
# @name fileUploadCompleted
POST {{tokenServiceBase}}/Token/v2/FileUploadCompleted
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "SiteID": "{{siteId}}",
  "FileName": "UDC_TS_SPA2K12_20260506043457965_1_R170.1.txt",
  "Path": "{{uploadPath}}"
}
